Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna run away with me, I know a galaxy ♪ 若你想与我私奔 我知道一个星系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can take you for a ride ♪ 我能带你去那里遨游兜风 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a premonition that we fell into a rhythm ♪ 预感我们将沉浸于这节奏 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the music don't stop for life ♪ 音乐不息 生命不止 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in my eyes ♪ 天际璀璨 映于我眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way I like ♪ 闪耀如我所愿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling like you need a little bit of company ♪ 若你此刻需要陪伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You met me at the perfect time ♪ 你我在最完美的时间相遇 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby ♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My sugarboo, I'm levitating ♪ 我的甜心 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way, we're renegading ♪ 我们将一同逃离银河系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, moonlight, you're my starlight ♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me ♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating ♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You, moonlight, you're my starlight ♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me ♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating ♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.69,0:00:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're for me, I feel it in our energy ♪ 我坚信你属于我 能量已诉说明晰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see us written in the stars ♪ 我们的名字刻于星辰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go wherever, so let's do it now or never ♪ 我们可以去任何地方 此刻莫再犹豫 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, nothing's ever, ever too far ♪ 亲爱的 没有什么是遥不可及 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in our eyes ♪ 天际璀璨 映于你我双眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way we are ♪ 闪耀如我们本真模样 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're forever every time we get together ♪ 每次相聚都恍若永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, let's get lost on Mars ♪ 但无论如何 让我们在火星恣意流浪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby ♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
